{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drowning in debt and trapped in the grind of 1990s corporate Japan, a struggling salaryman is offered an impossible way out: betray the very company that signs his paycheck. As a security specialist at METTA East, you'll balance double lives\u2014juggling office politics by day and corporate espionage by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack secure servers, manipulate rivals, gamble for survival, and climb the corporate ladder\u2014or burn it down. Navigate a branching story of loyalty, betrayal, and moral compromise, where every choice shapes your future. Will you play by the rules, cheat the system, or become something worse?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese Hacker Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To pay off your debt, you'll be expected to infiltrate secure servers in a strategic, node-based hacking minigame.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/demonstration.gif?t=1751352630\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll continually sharpen your hacking ability by unlocking new towers and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/hackingMenu.gif?t=1751352630\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese</strong>\u00a0<strong>Hustle Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Despite your espionage, you'll likely still be broke and have to work as everything from a barista to a garbage man.\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/dd47925f709b3a5a0beed6b6b33de5c4.avif?t=1751352630\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese</strong>\u00a0<strong>Worker Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And, of course, you still need to do your day job to keep your identity intact. (Don't fall behind like this worker, or you may face... dire repercussions).<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/1c769c5536939b251c0d6ebd106d2c82.avif?t=1751352630\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3098910?t=1751352630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/7ff3e29faa78e6bb236939c167f2f208cd8b7e94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751352630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751352630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751352630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drowning in debt and trapped in the grind of 1990s corporate Japan, a struggling salaryman is offered an impossible way out: betray the very company that signs his paycheck. As a security specialist at METTA East, you'll balance double lives\u2014juggling office politics by day and corporate espionage by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack secure servers, manipulate rivals, gamble for survival, and climb the corporate ladder\u2014or burn it down. Navigate a branching story of loyalty, betrayal, and moral compromise, where every choice shapes your future. Will you play by the rules, cheat the system, or become something worse?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese Hacker Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To pay off your debt, you'll be expected to infiltrate secure servers in a strategic, node-based hacking minigame.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/demonstration.gif?t=1751352630\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll continually sharpen your hacking ability by unlocking new towers and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/hackingMenu.gif?t=1751352630\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese</strong>\u00a0<strong>Hustle Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Despite your espionage, you'll likely still be broke and have to work as everything from a barista to a garbage man.\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/dd47925f709b3a5a0beed6b6b33de5c4.avif?t=1751352630\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Japanese</strong>\u00a0<strong>Worker Man</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And, of course, you still need to do your day job to keep your identity intact. (Don't fall behind like this worker, or you may face... dire repercussions).<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/1c769c5536939b251c0d6ebd106d2c82.avif?t=1751352630\" /></div></p>","developers":["Antikat","cNel"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/header.jpg?t=1751352630","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257137857,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137857/movie480.mp4?t=1746922004","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137857/movie_max.mp4?t=17